* **Programming:*****************
* **UI/UX:**************
* **Content & Research:************


Each team member will take primary responsibility for one area while collaborating across tasks.

---

### **Goal**

To create an engaging digital experience that allows users to explore the life of Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart in Salzburg through location-based storytelling, combining education with interactive technology.
